@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174/

### GET All employees
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Studio-Id: 65399519-4d06-4e7e-8489-54c23ae54a50


### PATCH Employee role
PATCH {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/role
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Studio-Id: 65399519-4d06-4e7e-8489-54c23ae54a50

{
  "userId": "4a4b87ef-3ac7-4dca-bf00-9be362d2c8d6",
  "roleId": 3
}

### DELETE Employee (soft delete)
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/4a4b87ef-3ac7-4dca-bf00-9be362d2c8d6
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: 65399519-4d06-4e7e-8489-54c23ae54a50